herapist. They can provide strategies to work through these emotions and help improve your family dynamics.\n\nIt's important to remember that feeling frustrated doesn't mean you're at fault or that you're a bad person. It's a natural human reaction. The key is to work on managing these emotions in healthy ways and to seek ways to improve communication and understanding within your family.\n\nDo you feel like you want to explore any of these ideas further?"}
